@startuml seq-pay-bill
title PayLink - Pay a Bill (ElectroCo) - Section 2.2, steps 1 to 8
autonumber

' OPEN QUESTIONS
' 1. Step 1: which module identifies the customer and checks the verification level
'    (assumed: Api authenticates, Accounts returns the level)?
' 2. Where is the payment created in state Initiated (assumed: Payments, after the fee total is known)?
' 3. Do the 5 / 10,000 EGP single-payment limits apply to the bill amount or to bill plus fee?
' 4. Biller refuses: the brief says Failed and the hold is released, while the state table says
'    Failed -> Refunded happens when the hold is released. Is the release done here or only in seq-refund-failed?
' 5. Timeout: is the "being processed" message to the customer an API response only or also a notification?
' 6. Which module records agent commission and fee income (assumed: Accounts, with the amounts from Fees)?
' 7. Is the idempotency key checked by Api or by Payments (not shown, not part of steps 1 to 8)?

participant CustomerApp
participant Api
participant Payments
participant Fraud
participant Fees
participant "Accounts (Wallet)" as Accounts
participant BillerIntegration
participant ElectroCoMock
participant Notifications

== Step 1: Login and limits ==
CustomerApp -> Api : login(credentials)
Api -> Accounts : getVerificationLevel(customerId)
Accounts --> Api : verificationLevel
Api --> CustomerApp : session established

== Step 2: Bill inquiry ==
CustomerApp -> Api : inquireBill(billerService, meterNumber)
Api -> BillerIntegration : inquire(meterNumber)
BillerIntegration -> ElectroCoMock : GET bill(meterNumber)
ElectroCoMock --> BillerIntegration : amountDue = 350.00 EGP
BillerIntegration --> Api : bill(350.00 EGP)

== Step 3: Fee and total ==
Api -> Fees : calculateFee(ElectroCo, 350.00)
Fees --> Api : fee = 2.50 EGP
Api --> CustomerApp : amount 350.00 + fee 2.50 = total 352.50 EGP

CustomerApp -> Api : pay(total 352.50 EGP, idempotencyKey)
Api -> Payments : createPayment(customerId, bill, fee, idempotencyKey)
Payments --> Api : payment [Initiated]

== Step 4: Fraud checks ==
Payments -> Fraud : check(customerId, 352.50 EGP)
alt Fraud check fails
    Fraud --> Payments : rejected(reason)
    Payments -> Payments : transition Initiated -> Rejected
    Payments --> Api : payment [Rejected] + reason
    Api --> CustomerApp : rejected(reason)
else Fraud check passes
    Fraud --> Payments : passed

    == Step 5: Hold the money ==
    Payments -> Accounts : placeHold(walletId, 352.50 EGP, paymentId)
    alt Insufficient funds
        Accounts --> Payments : insufficientFunds
        Payments -> Payments : transition Initiated -> Rejected
        Payments --> Api : payment [Rejected] + reason
        Api --> CustomerApp : rejected(insufficient funds)
    else Funds available
        Accounts --> Payments : holdPlaced (ledger entries written)
        Payments -> Payments : transition Initiated -> FundsHeld

        == Step 6: Call the biller ==
        Payments -> BillerIntegration : pay(paymentId as unique reference, 350.00 EGP)
        Payments -> Payments : transition FundsHeld -> SentToBiller
        BillerIntegration -> ElectroCoMock : POST payment(reference, 350.00)

        == Step 7: Confirmation ==
        alt Biller confirms (paid)
            ElectroCoMock --> BillerIntegration : paid
            BillerIntegration --> Payments : confirmed
            Payments -> Payments : transition SentToBiller -> Completed
            Payments -> Accounts : convertHoldToCharge(holdId)
            Accounts --> Payments : charged
            Payments -> Accounts : creditFeeIncome(2.50 EGP)
            Accounts --> Payments : done
            opt Agent involved
                Payments -> Accounts : creditAgentCommission(agentWalletId)
                Accounts --> Payments : done
            end

            == Step 8: Receipt ==
            Payments -> Notifications : send SMS + push (payment completed)
            Notifications --> Payments : accepted
            Payments --> Api : payment [Completed]
            Api --> CustomerApp : receipt
        else Biller refuses
            ElectroCoMock --> BillerIntegration : refused(errorCode)
            BillerIntegration --> Payments : refused(errorCode)
            Payments -> Payments : transition SentToBiller -> Failed
            Payments -> Accounts : releaseHold(holdId)
            Accounts --> Payments : holdReleased
            Payments -> Notifications : send SMS + push (payment failed, reason)
            Notifications --> Payments : accepted
            Payments --> Api : payment [Failed]
            Api --> CustomerApp : failed(reason)
        else No answer within 10 seconds (timeout)
            BillerIntegration --> Payments : timeout
            Payments -> Payments : transition SentToBiller -> Unknown
            note right of Accounts : Hold remains active.\nNo refund while Unknown.
            Payments --> Api : payment [Unknown]
            Api --> CustomerApp : payment is being processed
        end
    end
end
@enduml
